      "start_sec": 2.26,
      "end_sec": 13.73,
      "text": "My first name is O-S-C-A-R. My baloney has a second name, it's N-A-Y-E-R."
    },
    {
      "id": "speech-00002",
      "start_sec": 13.73,
      "end_sec": 26.26,
      "text": "I love to read it every day, and if you allow G and A."
